== Some thoughts on an audience

Who is this essay for? I mean, ideally, it's for me. Maybe it's for people who
don't take play seriously. Maybe it's for the old men at my college awards
ceremony who were surprised when they asked, "So what's next?" and I replied,
"Video games." Maybe it's for Ari, to show her that I am an academic. That one's
unlikely. Maybe it's for graduate admissions. Though again this is too complex
for a single essay -- maybe an excerpt would suffice. Maybe it's for a general
audience -- a published book, along the lines of what Žižek and Noë are doing.
Maybe it's directed toward Jagoda and his project. Maybe it's a thesis, to
define what my project is in the first place.